nsition text-[var(--accent)] font-medium underline underline-offset-1\" href=\"/services\">Services</a><a class=\"block py-3 px-4 text-[var(--nav-text)] hover:text-[var(--accent)] transition \" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a><a class=\"block py-3 px-4 text-[var(--nav-text)] hover:text-[var(--accent)] transition \" href=\"/blog\">Blog</a></div></div></header><div class=\"min-h-screen\"><section class=\"container mx-auto px-4 pt-20 pb-5 \"><p class=\"text-sm opacity-50 text-gray-800 dark:text-white\">Aria Aji — Front-end Developer, Bandung</p><h1 class=\"my-10 max-w-8xl text-4xl font-bold leading-tight sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl\">Websites and Online Stores That Are Built to Generate Results, Not Just Look Good.</h1><p class=\"mt-5 max-w-md text-xl opacity-85\">Specializing in high-performance landing pages and Shopify setup for brands that want to start selling right away. Built in days, not months.</p><a href=\"https://wa.me/6282120623351?text=Halo%2C%20I%20am%20interested%20in%20one%20of%20the%20service%20packages%20on%20this%20page.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"mt-8 text-lg button inline-flex items-center justify-center p-3 rounded-full text-center bg-[#FA6B48] hover:bg-black dark:hover:bg-white text-black dark:text-white  hover:text-[#FA6B48] inline-block rounded-lg bg-[#FA6B48] px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-black dark:text-white transition hover:opacity-90 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#FA6B48]\">Get Started</a></section><section class=\"container mx-auto px-4 py-10\"><div class=\"grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"pricing-card rounded-lg bg-black p-7 text-white dark:bg-[#FDFBF7] dark:text-gray-950\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold\">Business Website</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-md font-semibold text-[#FA6B48]\">Price based on project scope</p><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm opacity-85\">A fast solution for small and medium-sized Enterprises, F&amp;B businesses, and Personal Brands that need a professional online presence.</p><div class=\"mt-4 flex gap-4 text-xs opacity-60\"><span>3–7 Business Days</span><span>Next.js, Tailwind CSS</span></div><ul class=\"mt-5 space-y-2 text-sm\"><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-[#FA6B48]\">–</span><span>Custom design (not an instant template)</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-[#FA6B48]\">–</span><span>Fully responsive on mobile and desktop</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-[#FA6B48]\">–</span><span>High-performance loading optimization</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-[#FA6B48]\">–</span><span>WhatsApp / Contact Form</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-[#FA6B48]\">–</span><span>Google Maps integration</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-[#FA6B48]\">–</span><span>Basic domain &amp; hosting setup</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"pricing-card rounded-lg bg-black p-7 text-white dark:bg-[#FDFBF7] dark:text-gray-950\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold\">Shopify Store Setup</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-md font-semibold text-[#FA6B48]\">Price based on project scope</p><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm opacity-85\">A robust online store for fashion, retail, and physical product brands ready to start selling automatically.</p><div class=\"mt-4 flex gap-4 text-xs opacity-60\"><span>1–2 Weeks</span><span>Shopify Liquid</span></div><ul class=\"mt-5 space-y-2 text-sm\"><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-[#FA6B48]\">–</span><span>Shopify account setup and configuration</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-[#FA6B48]\">–</span><span>Theme design customization (Shopify Liquid)</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-[#FA6B48]\">–</span><span>Navigation, product, and collection structure</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-[#FA6B48]\">–</span><span>Local Payment Gateway integration (Midtrans/Xendit)</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-[#FA6B48]\">–</span><span>Automatic shipping cost setup</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-[#FA6B48]\">–</span><span>Optimized cart &amp; checkout pages</span></li></ul><p class=\"mt-5 border-t border-white/20 pt-4 text-xs opacity-60 dark:border-black/20\">Monthly Shopify subscription, domain, and third-party app costs are covered by the client.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"container mx-auto px-8 py-10 \"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">Additional Services</h2><div class=\"mt-5 divide-y divide-black/10 border-t border-black/10 dark:divide-white/10 dark:border-white/10 text-gray-900 dark:text-white\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between py-3 text-sm\"><span>Worry-Free Maintenance &amp; Updates</span><span class=\"opacity-80\">Price based on project scope</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between py-3 text-sm\"><span>Sales-Driven Copywriting</span><span class=\"opacity-80\">Price based on project scope</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between py-3 text-sm\"><span>Additional Page</span><span class=\"opacity-80\">Price based on project scope</span></div></div></section><section class=\"container mx-auto px-4 py-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">Work Process</h2><div class=\"mt-6 space-y-6 text-gray-800 dark:text-white\"><div class=\"step-item flex gap-4\"><span class=\"text-2xl font-bold opacity-50\">01</span><div><h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Discovery Call</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm opacity-90\">We dig into your business goals, target audience, and design preferences to ensure we are aligned.</p></div></div><div class=\"step-item flex gap-4\"><span class=\"text-2xl font-bold opacity-50\">02</span><div><h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Proposal &amp; 50% Deposit</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm opacity-90\">You receive a clear timeline and final pricing. An upfront payment secures your spot in our development schedule.</p></div></div><div class=\"step-item flex gap-4\"><span class=\"text-2xl font-bold opacity-50\">03</span><div><h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Development &amp; Review</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm opacity-90\">We build your site. You get up to 2 rounds of revisions for design and content to ensure it perfectly matches your vision.</p></div></div><div class=\"step-item flex gap-4\"><span class=\"text-2xl font-bold opacity-50\">04</span><div><h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Launch &amp; Handover</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm opacity-90\">Final 50% payment, your website goes live, and we hand over all credentials and necessary documentation.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"container mx-auto px-4 py-16\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">Interested in working together?</h2><a href=\"https://wa.me/6282120623351?text=Halo%2C%20I%20am%20interested%20in%20one%20of%20the%20service%20packages%20on%20this%20page.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"mt-5 text-lg button inline-flex items-center justify-center p-3 rounded-full text-center bg-[#FA6B48] hover:bg-black dark:hover:bg-white text-black dark:text-white hover:text-[#FA6B48] inline-block rounded-lg bg-[#FA6B48] px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-black dark:text-white transition hover:opacity-90 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#FA6B48]\">Chat via WhatsApp</a></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--><footer class=\"bg-[var(--footer-background)] border-t border-[var(--border)] mt-auto text-[var(--text-tertiary)] dark:text-[var(--text-tertiary)]\"><div class=\"container mx-auto py-6\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 px-[20px]\"><div><div class=\"group\"><a href=\"/\" class=\"flex\"><span class=\"hover:text-[var(--accent)] underline underline-offset-5 text-3xl font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)]\">Perkasa Wibowo</span><img src=\"/assets/img/peacock-black.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"w-[40px] h-[28px] md:w-[60px] md:h-[60px] hidden group-hover:block dark:group-hover:hidden group-focus-within:block\"/><img sr